   "quote": {
    "id": "q15",
    "text": "On 26 March 1989, Khomeini dismissed him officially, writing that were he to succeed him, he would hand the country over to the “liberals,” meaning presumably Bāzargān and the Freedom Movement, and through them to the monāfeqin.",
    "lang": "en",
    "cite": {
     "source": "iranica-algar-khomeini-life",
     "loc": {
      "section": "KHOMEINI i. Life",
      "para": "101"
     }
    },
